WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Shapes

2
00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:09.967
Windows, doors and roofs have many shapes. Let us count their sides and corners.

3
00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:13.600
A triangle has three sides and three corners.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.233
A rectangle has four sides, and its opposite sides are equal.

5
00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:20.867
A square has four equal sides and four square corners.

6
00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:24.800
Every shape with four sides is called a quadrilateral.
